# @hub-lanes

# ── CI BATCH LEDGER (BH-4971, BH-4964.3) ────────────────────────────────────
# The batch ledger lane: one worker ci_batches row per merge-queue batch run
# of Harness CI: what the ci-plan notice says it tested (mode, selected/total,
# escalation) and what it billed (sum of ceil(job seconds / 60) on MonkCI).
# Twice an hour, off the :00/:30 pile-up; at most PAGES + 2 x MAX GitHub reads,
# skipped while the bucket is low. Kill: bin/harness-ctl.sh off ci-batch-ledger.
11,41 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/ci-batch-ledger.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
